    "body": "just use sm80 in ArchTag.  ArchTag is more like the minimum arch that supports the kernel.  sm86, sm80, sm89 use the same type of kernel.\r\n\r\nyou need your device arch in your cmake command line.  e.g. sm89 for 4090, so that nvcc will generate the best binary for your gpu.",
